    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/30/Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250615010335\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hikage Emotionless Ninja Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/30/Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250615010335\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"584\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hikage Emotionless Ninja Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>无情忍者</b>\n</p><p><b>Hikage</b>  是来自《闪乱神乐》电子游戏系列的角色。她在《闪乱神乐：少女的肖像》中首次登场。\n\n</p><p>她在日文版中由白石凉子配音，英文版中由卡拉·爱德华兹配音。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHikage%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Hikage</b>  是一个无表情的女孩，中长发，棕色眼睛，眼神中带着鬼祟或野性。她在潜行时倾向于吐舌头。她的黄色和黑色条纹衬衫，带有黑色褶边，非常短，止于胸线，露出大量乳沟，只覆盖右肩。她脖子上戴着细项链，黑色皮革束缚沿着手臂向下。她的破旧蓝色牛仔裤拉链拉下，腰带解开，膝盖以下有皮革束缚，左大腿有红色蛇纹。她左臀和左胸上有蛇纹身。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHikage%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Hikage</b>  她很少，如果有的话，展现情感，即使展现，程度也很低。她自己说，最好的描述她的方式是「蝉蜕」。因此，她的情绪很难捉摸。她还非常冷漠和慵懒，面对问题时，她往往走神，陷入沉思。\n\n</p><p>不过，她经常完全无视周围发生的一切，通常导致她陷入奇怪的境地。她倾向于随波逐流，好奇一切如何发展。她尽力通过直言不讳和明确表达自己的想法和意见来弥补表情的缺乏，但这常常让她显得社交笨拙。她也非常直率和诚实，按照她看到的方式陈述事物，有时会显得粗鲁或不考虑他人感受。\n\n</p><p>尽管  <b>Hikage</b>  她虽然不理解情感，却有强烈的欲望去理解它们。最初，日影从未对它们多想过，说它们的短暂性总是让她觉得「烦人」。然而，在遇见某人后，她开始对它们产生个人兴趣。  <b>Katsuragi</b>，表示她从未在与她战斗时感到如此生机勃勃。因此为她开辟了一条新的道路。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e3/Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250615010336\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hikage Emotionless Ninja S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e3/Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250615010336\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1040\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hikage Emotionless Ninja S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f2/Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_Frantic_Swimsuit_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250615193913\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hikage Emotionless Ninja Frantic Swimsuit Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f2/Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_Frantic_Swimsuit_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250615193913\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1033\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hikage Emotionless Ninja Frantic Swimsuit Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hikage_Emotionless_Ninja_Frantic_Swimsuit_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820042811\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39940-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820042811 and revision id 64356. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
